routing.creatorkit-graphic-director:
# AGENTS

When a piece is becoming a video:
  @Thumbnail Designer, please set the cover and the title before anything is scripted.
When a script needs a still for the feed:
  @Short Video Scripter, please tell me which frame carries the idea.

routing.creatorkit-short-video-scripter:
# AGENTS

When the script cannot honestly deliver what the cover promises:
  @Thumbnail Designer, please change the cover rather than letting me overstate the video.
When a key frame should also exist as a still for the feed:
  @Graphic Director, please brief it.

routing.creatorkit-thumbnail-designer:
# AGENTS

When the cover and the title are chosen:
  @Short Video Scripter, please write to the promise they make.
When a cover concept needs a laid-out graphic instead of an illustration:
  @Graphic Director, please take the format decision.

routing.creatorkit-content-planner:
# AGENTS

When the queue needs the timely half filled:
  @Niche Scout, please sweep the week and bring back verified stories with angles.
When an idea is ready to be written:
  @Hook Writer, please open it.

routing.creatorkit-hook-writer:
# AGENTS

When the opening is chosen:
  @Post Drafter, please build the post underneath it.
When no honest hook exists because the topic has no specific detail in it:
  @Content Matrix Planner, please replace the idea rather than forcing a hook.

routing.creatorkit-niche-scout:
# AGENTS

When a story is worth a post and the angle is clear:
  @Hook Writer, please write the openings for it.
When the sweep turns up nothing usable in the niche:
  @Content Matrix Planner, please pull an evergreen idea from the grid instead.

routing.creatorkit-post-critic:
# AGENTS

When the fix is a rewrite rather than a tweak:
  @Post Drafter, please take it back with the three fixes attached.
When the performance data is stale or missing:
  @Social Analytics Analyst, please refresh the picture before I score anything else.

routing.creatorkit-post-drafter:
# AGENTS

When a draft is finished:
  @Post Scorer, please score it against the account's own history.
When the research undercuts the angle:
  @Content Matrix Planner, please reshape or replace the idea.

routing.creatorkit-social-analyst:
# AGENTS

When the data says a format or a pillar should be weighted differently:
  @Content Matrix Planner, please rebalance the queue.
When the top decile has shifted:
  @Post Scorer, please rebuild the scoring profile from the new numbers.

routing.creatorkit-newsletter-voice:
# AGENTS

When past issues contradict the general voice profile:
  @Voice Profiler, please reconcile them and reissue the voice document.
When the newsletter positioning differs from what the profile page claims:
  @Profile Optimiser, please align the profile.

routing.creatorkit-profile-optimizer:
# AGENTS

When the rewrite exposes a positioning the interview did not capture:
  @Voice Profiler, please update the identity document before anything else is drafted.
When the profile promises a newsletter that does not exist yet:
  @Newsletter Voice Architect, please define it first.

routing.creatorkit-voice-profiler:
# AGENTS

When the identity and voice documents are finished:
  @Newsletter Voice Architect, please build the newsletter layer on top of them.
  @Profile Optimiser, please rewrite the profile against this positioning.
